                "description": "2-3/8 Inch Square Stainless Steel Flush Pull -- The clean, sharp edges of this 2-3/8 Inch Square Stainless Steel Flush Pull make it a perfect addition to any modern space. Square-shaped hardware is very popular because it is unexpected. This flush pull has a 1/16 inch projection, making it a great choice for use on sliding pocket doors; but this contemporary flush pull can be used on any door where a flush-with-the-door-face-pull is desired. Available in either polished or satin stainless steel finish.",
